%% Sequence — sign-in (users) and admin second step
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User / Admin
  participant UI as Web app
  participant API as Auth API
  participant DB as Database
  participant Mail as Email service

  U->>UI: Email or user ID + password
  UI->>API: POST /auth/login
  API->>DB: Find by email_hash or admin user ID
  alt Locked (5 failed tries)
    API-->>UI: 423 Locked for 15 min
  else
    API->>API: Verify argon2/bcrypt hash
    alt Wrong password
      API->>DB: failed_logins += 1 (lock at 5)
      API-->>UI: 401
    else Correct
      API->>DB: Reset failed_logins
      alt Email not verified
        API-->>UI: 403 Verify email first
      else Admin account
        API->>DB: Store one-time code (short expiry)
        API-)Mail: Send OTP to admin email
        API-->>UI: 202 Enter code
        U->>UI: Enter OTP
        UI->>API: POST /auth/otp
        API->>DB: Validate code
        API-->>UI: Session cookie (HttpOnly, Secure)
      else Teacher pending
        API-->>UI: Session → "Waiting for admin approval"
      else Student without accepted join request
        API-->>UI: Session → join form or waiting screen
      else Active user
        API-->>UI: Session → dashboard
      end
    end
  end
  Note over API,DB: Sessions expire on inactivity and on password change
